# QMLSV: use the canonical Bollerslev-Ghysels returns supplied with gretl.
# The 500-observation subsample follows the package manual's worked example.
open b-g.gdt --quiet
smpl 1475 1974
# Harvey-Shephard QML, random-walk volatility and Student-t(8) innovations.
# This follows the alternative model shown in the published manual.
bundle m = qml_sv(Y, 2, 1, 1, 1, 8, 0)
qml_plot(&m, 1, 0)
